# The Dockerfile COPYs exactly three things: go.mod, go.sum and *.go. So this
# denies the whole context and re-admits only those, rather than listing what
# to leave out. A denylist has to be updated every time something new appears
# in the repo root, and it was already behind: the previous one named neither
# .claude/ nor .github/, so both were being shipped to the daemon for nothing.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
